</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">试一试！试一试！试一试！</span></p><p begin="1:30.073" end="1:30.937" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:30.073" end="1:30.537">ねぇ</span><span begin="1:30.537" end="1:30.937">ねぇ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我说我说</span></p><p begin="1:31.145" end="1:34.408" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.145" end="1:31.621">強</span><span begin="1:31.621" end="1:31.873">す</span><span begin="1:31.873" end="1:32.100">ぎ</span><span begin="1:32.100" end="1:32.353">る</span><span begin="1:32.353" end="1:32.588">こ</span><span begin="1:32.588" end="1:32.832">と</span><span begin="1:32.832" end="1:33.099">は</span><span begin="1:33.099" end="1:33.593">罪</span><span begin="1:33.593" end="1:33.807">な</span><span begin="1:33.807" end="1:34.408">の？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">太强也是一种罪吗？</span></p><p begin="1:34.450" end="1:38.413" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:34.450" end="1:34.612">使</span><span begin="1:34.612" end="1:34.867">え</span><span begin="1:34.867" end="1:35.105">る</span><span begin="1:35.105" end="1:35.330">も</span><span begin="1:35.330" end="1:35.563">の</span><span begin="1:35.563" end="1:35.800">は</span><span begin="1:35.800" end="1:36.256">全</span><span begin="1:36.256" end="1:36.474">て</span><span begin="1:36.814" end="1:37.251">使</span><span begin="1:37.251" end="1:37.492">い</span><span begin="1:37.492" end="1:37.723">ま</span><span begin="1:37.723" end="1:37.988">しょ</span><span begin="1:37.988" end="1:38.413">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">能用的一切就全部利用吧</span></p><p begin="1:38.842" end="1:41.928" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:38.842" end="1:39.347">強</span><span begin="1:39.347" end="1:39.565">す</span><span begin="1:39.565" end="1:39.792">ぎ</span><span begin="1:39.792" end="1:40.013">る</span><span begin="1:40.013" end="1:40.242">こ</span><span begin="1:40.242" end="1:40.464">と</span><span begin="1: