pan><span begin="2:00.730" end="2:00.821">き</span><span begin="2:00.821" end="2:00.938">ま</span><span begin="2:00.938" end="2:01.165">しょ！」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">「去游泳吧！」</span></p><p begin="2:01.360" end="2:02.952" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:01.360" end="2:01.505">「い</span><span begin="2:01.505" end="2:01.705">や</span> <span begin="2:01.886" end="2:02.366">私</span><span begin="2:02.366" end="2:02.601">は</span><span begin="2:02.601" end="2:02.952">ダ」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">「不，我可不」</span></p><p begin="2:02.481" end="2:04.141" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:02.481" end="2:02.837">「むっ！</span><span begin="2:02.975" end="2:03.072">付き</span><span begin="2:03.072" end="2:03.249">合</span><span begin="2:03.249" end="2:03.392">うっ</span><span begin="2:03.392" end="2:03.536">て</span><span begin="2:03.536" end="2:03.720">約</span><span begin="2:03.720" end="2:04.141">束！」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">「哼！明明约好要奉陪的！」</span></p><p begin="2:03.653" end="2:05.371" itunes:key="L45" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:03.653" end="2:04.161">「ふふ</span> <span begin="2:04.161" end="2:04.386">探</span><span begin="2:04.386" end="2:04.554">索</span><span begin="2:04.554" end="2:04.745">も</span><span begin="2:04.745" end="2:04.959">良い</span><span begin="2:04.959" end="2:05.090">で</span><span begin="2:05.090" end="2:05.192">す</span><span begin="2:05.192" end="2:05.371">ね」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">「呵呵，去探索也不错呢」</span></p><p begin="2:05.436" end="2:06.650" itunes:key="L46" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:05.436" end="2:05.607">「「「よ</span><span begin="2:05.607" end="2:05.800">し</span><span begin="2:05.800" end="2:05.998">全</span><span begin="2:05.998" end="2:06.124">部</span><span begin="2:06.124" end="2:06.266">や</span><span begin="2:06.266" end="2:06.631">ろう</span><span begin="2:06.631" end="2:06.650">！！」」」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang